  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Energy Expansion through Decentralized Solar PV and Storage in the Dominican Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Government of Dominican Republic to expand the solar PV capacity by increasing the knowledge and expereince in the services of Energy Storage and to provide alternative solutions for small Solar PV without battery storage.This project will be a bridge for a larger projects, theEconomic Innovation Partnership Program (EIPP) sponsored by the Korea Development Institute (KDI) and the Center for International Development (CID).</narrative>
  </description>
